Description:
Get a 4% discount on your first order with promo code "START." Plus, find a variety of current discounts, promotions, and hot deals in the app. Don't miss out!

The Santekhnika-Online store offers 230,000 products: toilets, shower enclosures, faucets, bathtubs, bathroom furniture, and everything you need for tiling. Choose from 1,000+ different brands for your apartment, home, garden, or cottage renovation.

👨‍🔧 14 years of experience and many happy customers. Our extensive selection and easy-to-use app will help you find your perfect interior and design.

Our customers appreciate:

- Expert support at every stage;

- Free design solutions for customers;

- Manufacturer's warranty, returns, and exchanges;

- Discounted delivery zones;

- Uniform delivery rate in the regions where we operate;

– 5-minute order processing;

– Pickup locations;

– Installation and service;

– Professional consultations;

– Years of experience.

🚿
The Santekhnika-online online store offers all the necessary products for both DIYers and professionals. The app has everything you need to design your home and furniture.

Monthly promotions and sales on plumbing and home goods;

Seasonal discounts and special offers;

Save time and money – all promotions in one place.

Finishing materials, porcelain tiles in various styles, paints and varnishes, household goods;

Furniture: sofa, wardrobe, sofa bed. We also offer tables, chairs, chests of drawers, and armchairs. A variety of kitchen sets;

Home appliances, HVAC equipment (air conditioners, heaters), lighting, power tools, and many other devices;

Accessories, decor, textiles, decorative items, linen storage boxes;

Hand and power tools for apartment construction and renovation;

Products for leisure, summer cottages, gardens, and vegetable gardens.

🛁
Additional services:

— Schedule a consultation with an interior designer in one of our stores or online throughout Russia!

— Experienced plumbing and furniture installers will help you make your renovation a breeze!

— Professional consultations with product selection specialists are available free of charge in our app;

— We'll help you choose the right models;

— We'll develop an interior plan for your apartment or house;

— We'll develop a design project from scratch in 2 days. The project includes: 3D visualization of the room, furniture and plumbing plan, wall and floor finishing plan, and a ready-made list of products. You can order in the app.

🌍
Delivery geography:

We deliver products by courier to your home or to a pickup point for in-store pickup.
Over 40 stores
and pickup points throughout Russia: Moscow, St. Petersburg, Yekaterinburg, Samara, Krasnodar, and others. Find your city by downloading the app!

Current discounts apply to popular categories: plumbing fixtures, bathtubs, shower enclosures, and accessories.

Quality guarantee on all products, convenient ordering, and delivery.

The app is updated regularly; download it now to stay up-to-date on new promotions.
